# Smoke-test artifacts. The CLI's default output path is audits/<host>/.
# Smoke runs MUST stay out of commits because they capture live HTTP
# responses including OAuth credentials returned by /register endpoints
# (RFC 7591 §3.2). Audit reports for publication live in the separate
# mcp-audits repo, not here. outputs/ kept for legacy invocations and
# future tooling that may write there.
audits/
outputs/

